reas. A total of 107 companies belong to the Infortar group, including 3 associates and 2 subsidiaries of associates. Infortar employs 6890 people."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Additional information:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kadri Laanvee"]},{"type":"p","children":["Investor Relations Manager"]},{"type":"p","children":["Phone: +372 5156662"]},{"type":"p","children":["e-mail: ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=QR8fsQLy4OogqV7WGMI2guGfHslYHzvxG1_l9fLJp84i5ez7k5lxuOiPAdgoD3ZHY1DcEU1oRkMCC0iGKjvnk81pwvw_kKSSe8DsFwaZ6y-PI7FH5UQSTZPzZKAvEhZ7Gz5WRY9snfNexOGtviGrEJID7iSSh512a9eVoJiaBlYI0JGqX-7hZWwMTJET5UZBqp-J2JKS2XPxYvdOn2yS1ahuHNJ8KqbwHxScLuTl9hRFBDh1rPQokDd41XtyL4QocO-9SYaCgn6KIr63CDA4diTu0asv10g4JH3IaMi4AXu_7Ak4C-rnzOW8ECfm4tdrvG4Q0Iy5hxX9t_hMMY9rWYa1ajYjntU6ATA9PWSPaxS-9w3D7vQDm2EpyszR5QsOalnCw5isIqgwHYKBE9udpNVFoQIhpnDFVHSq7O09-9o7Cs3vGTxc9_JI_Sa5EgsQW3Bsli698PhhzDzdjpIuxOvdZPZKKNt0uk5qvdTTYBRroecgoZOQd-j5g3RC58qZ5eSd2T7xxWODStdWJ2clJ7S8V2MR-43uran8bgSz1-E6bbvZ7rbVdquKoxuGO8wLQvUWB6EKPe9NGCPZLYkzMagAADTdExfXuouJtWA7pdUEhXVwdZnhi0qzSX8DB-sN--tPORr8WNqlH6ZNyYY6gqNSnb2wnpBO58GrqxrGZ_JlzmrfbdIy9htYjII8892y8hhkCPo_jsjB4jYW1wGPbQftsIPVMpxfXOwL47rtJRBQn93YEc8LeKcZApACmK2HbSS8H6h5xK0K65G0a6lhT8p9QHguP9b3QTw9JIo5AYLyd3VsGlqUf3QsbudpwSRLWN2sB0DNne2SpLn19TKpBdYzPoZJYQBhp2MgjZWs6leSbEE2N3CNV7ytH-lhVTBm8T7jI3nv9U9cHpMEnEkJwA==","linkText":"kadri.laanvee@infortar.ee"}}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=iPbU85VwH2_jV9AY2lAJ8h8zuwaqja9wRUioDLX7smDwfpZlSk_6C2uvLhWV1e0TMfr0Sr8E8GscyVKBQlHsXCc63_oZmiMz-OpaPkMe9T8F8WIviR5c1acAP8j6o4xJm2KnnKM162WMC4Ldf_n1Zkt4pyT8n8JOco_sqocLf6Znp3bcbwvzozWpjl7d5bcsyd-4-NurO4KvdkAjGmhq98JTjV9iocmH1vxpSOSvw_2SZ4N6vTEU549mqg8mpCE1K3kTnMUjACaOykaWOMDYFBL_ZUBuMCMwllIMgdnCeqL5j9lIvIEc8NaTHmxZnj-AuI06EWZy2Zpc1lJHDEhhpAE1o2L_fKCDypC4sDKJzRjCdr8jC2uAbUPNM60Asn6L9ERJRmWIqD5Lsi3N7q7_tEMv7cnHJRcXyw5OGcIHZzBMRSKEM3pFDUVBDnLtx5nlP9aZbCYNYo--gIR3Ax5YPIPhRMSyRg